Matrix-keyboard delivery order + FIFO depth for the Sony NEWS HLE
keyboard (nws3260 / newsos station). Guest-side fix: modifier edges are
delivered before/after the characters they qualify within a scan cycle,
and the key FIFO is deepened so fast bursts are not silently dropped.
See scripts/build-guests/emulators/native.d/newsos.sh. (kbdfix 2026-08-18)

